#. metadata.json->name
msgid "Relay Switches"
msgstr "Relais-Schalter"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid ""
"Switch HTTP relay boards (sockets, coffee machine, printer, ...) from the "
"panel. Any number of switches and groups, status read back from the board."
msgstr ""
"Schaltet HTTP-Relaisboards (Steckdosen, Kaffeemaschine, Drucker, ...) direkt "
"aus der Leiste. Beliebig viele Schalter und Gruppen, Status wird vom Board "
"zurückgelesen."

#. settings-schema.json->page-switches->title
#. settings-schema.json->switches->description
#. settings-schema.json->groups->columns->title
msgid "Switches"
msgstr "Schalter"

#. settings-schema.json->page-panel->title
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Leiste"

#. settings-schema.json->page-behavior->title
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Verhalten"

#. settings-schema.json->section-info->title
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "So funktioniert's"

#. settings-schema.json->section-switches->title
msgid "Relays / sockets"
msgstr "Relais / Steckdosen"

#. settings-schema.json->section-groups->title
#. settings-schema.json->groups->description
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Gruppen"

#. settings-schema.json->section-panel->title
msgid "Panel appearance"
msgstr "Aussehen in der Leiste"

#. settings-schema.json->section-click->title
msgid "Middle mouse button"
msgstr "Mittlere Maustaste"

#. settings-schema.json->section-status->title
msgid "Status display"
msgstr "Statusanzeige"

#. settings-schema.json->section-network->title
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Netzwerk"

#. settings-schema.json->info-label->description
msgid ""
"One row per switch in the menu. Several hosts (comma separated) are switched "
"together; the status is read back from the board after every action."
msgstr ""
"Eine Zeile = ein Schalter im Menü. Mehrere Hosts (Komma) werden gemeinsam "
"geschaltet; der Status wird nach jeder Aktion vom Board gelesen."

#. settings-schema.json->switches->tooltip
msgid ""
"Order of the rows is the order in the menu, names must be unique.\n"
"Host(s): 192.168.1.50 or http://board.local:8080 - separate several with "
"commas.\n"
"On/Off/Status are paths appended to the host; leave empty for the defaults (/"
"relay?state=1, /relay?state=0, /relay)."
msgstr ""
"Reihenfolge = Reihenfolge im Menü, Namen müssen eindeutig sein.\n"
"Host(s): 192.168.1.50 oder http://board.local:8080 - mehrere mit Komma "
"trennen.\n"
"Ein/Aus/Status sind Pfade, die an den Host angehängt werden; leer = Standard "
"(/relay?state=1, /relay?state=0, /relay)."

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->groups->columns->title
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Name"

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->groups->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->panel-icon->description
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Symbol"

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
msgid "Host(s)"
msgstr "Host(s)"

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
msgid "On"
msgstr "Ein"

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

#. settings-schema.json->switches->columns->title
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. settings-schema.json->groups->tooltip
msgid ""
"Optional: combine several switches into one additional switch. Member names "
"must match the switch list exactly, separated by commas."
msgstr ""
"Optional: mehrere Schalter zu einem zusätzlichen Schalter bündeln. Namen "
"exakt wie in der Schalter-Liste, mit Komma getrennt."

#. settings-schema.json->panel-display->description
msgid "Text next to the icon"
msgstr "Text neben dem Symbol"

#. settings-schema.json->panel-display->tooltip
msgid "The text only appears while at least one switch is on."
msgstr "Der Text erscheint nur, wenn mindestens ein Schalter an ist."

#. settings-schema.json->panel-display->options
#. settings-schema.json->middle-click->options
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Nichts"

#. settings-schema.json->panel-display->options
msgid "Count (2/4)"
msgstr "Anzahl (2/4)"

#. settings-schema.json->panel-display->options
msgid "Names of the active switches"
msgstr "Namen der aktiven Schalter"

#. settings-schema.json->panel-icon->tooltip
msgid ""
"Icon name (e.g. network-server-symbolic) or a file. Symbolic icons follow "
"the panel color."
msgstr ""
"Symbolname (z. B. network-server-symbolic) oder eine Datei. Symbolische "
"Symbole übernehmen die Farbe der Leiste."

#. settings-schema.json->panel-icon-on->description
msgid "Icon while something is on"
msgstr "Symbol, wenn etwas an ist"

#. settings-schema.json->panel-icon-on->tooltip
msgid ""
"Leave empty to keep the same icon. A colored icon makes the active state "
"visible at a glance."
msgstr ""
"Leer lassen für dasselbe Symbol. Ein farbiges Symbol macht den Zustand auf "
"einen Blick sichtbar."

#. settings-schema.json->middle-click->description
msgid "Action on middle click"
msgstr "Aktion bei Mittelklick"

#. settings-schema.json->middle-click->options
msgid "Switch everything on"
msgstr "Alle einschalten"

#. settings-schema.json->middle-click->options
msgid "Switch everything off"
msgstr "Alle ausschalten"

#. settings-schema.json->middle-click->options
msgid "Open menu"
msgstr "Menü öffnen"

#. settings-schema.json->poll-interval->description
msgid "Status check interval"
msgstr "Status-Abfrageintervall"

#. settings-schema.json->poll-interval->tooltip
msgid "0 = no automatic polling (status is read when the menu opens)."
msgstr ""
"0 = keine automatische Abfrage (Status wird beim Öffnen des Menüs gelesen)."

#. settings-schema.json->poll-interval->units
#. settings-schema.json->timeout->units
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "Sekunden"

#. settings-schema.json->notify-errors->description
msgid "Notify when a device does not respond"
msgstr "Benachrichtigung, wenn ein Gerät nicht antwortet"

#. settings-schema.json->show-all-items->description
msgid "Show 'All on' / 'All off' in the menu"
msgstr "'Alle einschalten' / 'Alle ausschalten' im Menü anzeigen"

#. settings-schema.json->timeout->description
msgid "HTTP timeout"
msgstr "HTTP-Zeitlimit"
